  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Cannon — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level, you have honed your technique to the maximum, gaining your domain expansion. While inside it, at Initiative 20, you can choose up to three targets to suffer the full effects of <em>Granite Blast</em>. </p>\n<p>While in <em>Technique Burnout</em> after your domain ends, you cannot use any Innate Technique features other than <em>Granite Blast</em>.</p>",
